SUMMARY:MAGNOLIA OIL & GAS OPERATING LLC — Investor Call
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: MAGNOLIA OIL & GAS OPERATING LLC\nRoadshow: https://www.netroadsho
 w.com/events/login/1PeTHmojHEwAAGvvpbFnNBDwFklvTdAqPUz0S\n\nDeal context:\
 nMagnolia Oil & Gas Operating LLC and Magnolia Oil & Gas Finance Corp. are
  bringing a $500 million 8-year Senior Unsecured Notes offering to market\
 , rated Ba3/BB- at the issue level (Ba2/BB- at the corporate level)\, with
  initial price talk in the high 6s to 7% range. The deal is being used to 
 fund the acquisition of WildFire Energy\, alongside equity proceeds\, RBL 
 facility borrowings\, and cash on hand\, with a special mandatory redempti
 on feature at par if the WildFire acquisition is not completed by March 19
 \, 2027. The transaction is structured as 144A/Reg S for Life with NC-3 ca
 ll protection\, a 40% equity clawback for the first three years\, and a ch
 ange of control put at 101%\, with Citi acting as left lead among 12 joint
  bookrunners.
